WEBVTT

00:08:58.857 --> 00:09:00.395
(Laughter)

00:09:00.419 --> 00:09:03.361
[The low tar, low nicotine cigarette.]

00:09:03.385 --> 00:09:05.301
And then it says, "Think about it."

00:09:05.325 --> 00:09:08.603
And then even below that
in the small print

00:09:08.627 --> 00:09:11.507
are tar numbers and nicotine numbers.

00:09:12.333 --> 00:09:14.452
What was a light cigarette?

00:09:15.474 --> 00:09:16.942
How did it work?

00:09:18.474 --> 00:09:21.172
This is an illustration
of the product modification

00:09:21.196 --> 00:09:23.730
known as "filter ventilation."

00:09:24.128 --> 00:09:25.787
That's not a real filter blown up.

00:09:25.811 --> 00:09:27.001
That's just a picture

00:09:27.025 --> 00:09:30.231
so that you could see the rows
of laser-perforated ventilation holes